    "created_at": "2024-04-09T18:40:30Z",
    "updated_at": "2024-04-10T02:17:10Z",
    "body": "> As HTML updated to allow div to group dt and dd elements, and per the mentioned PR https://github.com/whatwg/html/pull/9124 to allow hr within select, it seems reasonable that ol, ul and menu elements should also allow hr as a way to separate li elements into 'groups'.\r\n\r\nCouldn't agree more.",
